      "writtenOn": "2015-01-07T02:21:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I will change this to do 1 micro-second sleep.\n\nFor usleep function, it is not accurate at all in single digit range, at least in ectool. And for LPC, with a 19MHz bus, each IO is about 0.7 micro-second, but other chipset could have faster LPC bus, so it should still do a minimal of 1 micro-second sleep.",
